  "definitions": {
    "filter_checks_per_get": "(rocksdb.bloom.filter.useful + rocksdb.bloom.filter.full.positive) / rocksdb.number.keys.read. Includes the Get in RMW. Undefined for E, which performs scans/inserts.",
